@pass `[creativebrewing] members:` line; no `Missing or unsupported`; no script error; `lava_vision.js` still skipped (Alex's Mobs is IN the cooking set: expect it loaded now, so no skip line)
@fails the optional mod named in the error: its guard in CD/CB
